# Go
**/vendor/
# Compiled binaries named after their module (e.g. `go build ./...` run
# from inside auth-service/ or evaluation-service/ produces a binary with
# no extension matching the directory name) — never actually gitignored
# before now, a real gap found while testing the Phase 3 instrumentation.
/auth-service/auth-service
/evaluation-service/evaluation-service

# Python
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.venv/
**/venv/
